      "created_at": "2013-04-18T03:47:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, after playing a couple game testing out each character deck at least 4-5 times, I felt like that Unity is too dependant of her bots.</p><p>I love the theme of the deck but 30-40% of the time she either doesn't have any equipment to destroy to put bots, she doesn't have bots in her hand or unfornatunatly you have got a villain/enviromnent that alway kill them</p><p>So I was wondering if anyone found some kind of \"house rules\" or \"fix\" you could to Unity's deck to give her more flexibility?</p>",
