      "raw": "<p>Hi, after playing a couple game testing out each character deck at least 4-5 times, I felt like that Unity is too dependant of her bots.</p><p>I love the theme of the deck but 30-40% of the time she either doesn&#39;t have any equipment to destroy to put bots, she doesn&#39;t have bots in her hand or unfornatunatly you have got a villain/enviromnent that alway kill them</p><p>So I was wondering if anyone found some kind of &quot;house rules&quot; or &quot;fix&quot; you could to Unity&#39;s deck to give her more flexibility?</p>",
